FormalGroupLaws -- commutative formal group laws
************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides elementary functions to deal with commutative formal
group laws of dimension one.

Authors
=======

  * Baptiste Calmès (see http://bcalmes.perso.math.cnrs.fr/ )
  * Viktor Petrov

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.2 of FormalGroupLaws, released February
26, 2010.

