- FormalGroupPoint -- inverse to a point of a formal group
**********************************************************

  * Operator: *note -: (Macaulay2Doc)-,
  * Usage: 
        -s
  * Inputs:
      * s, an instance of the type *note FormalGroupPoint: FormalGroupPoint,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note FormalGroupPoint: FormalGroupPoint,, 

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : ZZ[x,y]                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = ZZ[x..y]                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = FGL(series(x+y+x*y,10))                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = FormalGroupLaw{x*y + x + y, 10}                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : FormalGroupLaw                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : ZZ[u]                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = ZZ[u]                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : s = formalGroupPoint(f,series(u^2+u,5))                                 |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                     2       |
|o4 = FormalGroupPoint{FormalGroupLaw{x*y + x + y, 10}, FormalSeries{u  + u,  |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : FormalGroupPoint                                                        |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|5}}                                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : t = -s                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                       4    3|
|o5 = FormalGroupPoint{FormalGroupLaw{x*y + x + y, 10}, FormalSeries{- u  + u |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : FormalGroupPoint                                                        |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|- u, 5}}                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : s+t                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = FormalGroupPoint{FormalGroupLaw{x*y + x + y, 10}, FormalSeries{0, 5}}   |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : FormalGroupPoint                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

