formalGroupPoint(FormalGroupLaw,FormalSeries) -- constructing a formal group point
**********************************************************************************

  * Function: *note formalGroupPoint: formalGroupPoint,
  * Usage: 
        formalGroupPoint(f,s)
  * Inputs:
      * f, an instance of the type *note FormalGroupLaw: FormalGroupLaw,, 
      * s, an instance of the type *note FormalSeries: FormalSeries,, with the
        same coefficient ring as f
  * Outputs:
      * p, an instance of the type *note FormalGroupPoint: FormalGroupPoint,, 

Description
===========

This constructs an object of the class FormalGroupPoint out of a FormalGroupLaw
and a FormalSeries with the same coefficient ring and such that s has precision
at most that of f.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : ZZ[x,y]                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = ZZ[x..y]                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f=FGL(series(x+y+x*y,2))                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = FormalGroupLaw{x*y + x + y, 2}                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : FormalGroupLaw                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : ZZ[u,v]                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = ZZ[u..v]                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : s = series(u+v+u^2,2)                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|                   2                                                         |
|o4 = FormalSeries{u  + u + v, 2}                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : FormalSeries                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : p= formalGroupPoint(f,s)                                                |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                    2        |
|o5 = FormalGroupPoint{FormalGroupLaw{x*y + x + y, 2}, FormalSeries{u  + u +  |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : FormalGroupPoint                                                        |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|v, 2}}                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

