FormalSeries -- the class of all formal series
**********************************************

Description
===========

An object of the class FormalSeries is a list \{P,n\} where P is an element of
a polynomial ring and n is an integer representing the precision (the terms in
degree strictly greater than n are considered zero).

Types of FormalSeries:
======================

  * *note FormalGroupLaw: FormalGroupLaw, -- the class of all formal group laws

