inverse(FormalSeries) -- multiplicative inverse of formal series
****************************************************************

  * Function: *note inverse: (Macaulay2Doc)inverse,
  * Usage: 
        inverse(s)
  * Inputs:
      * s, an instance of the type *note FormalSeries: FormalSeries,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note FormalSeries: FormalSeries,, the
        multiplicative inverse of the formal series s

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R=ZZ[x,y]                                                   |
|                                                                 |
|o1 = R                                                           |
|                                                                 |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : s = series(2*x^2*y+x*y+x^2+x+y+1,3)                         |
|                                                                 |
|                    2     2                                      |
|o2 = FormalSeries{2x y + x  + x*y + x + y + 1, 3}                |
|                                                                 |
|o2 : FormalSeries                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : inverse(s)                                                  |
|                                                                 |
|                   3    2       2    3          2                |
|o3 = FormalSeries{x  - x y - x*y  - y  + x*y + y  - x - y + 1, 3}|
|                                                                 |
|o3 : FormalSeries                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

If the constant coefficient of s is not +1 or -1, inverse returns an error.

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note inverse(FormalSeries): inverse_lpFormalSeries_rp, -- multiplicative
    inverse of formal series
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

